            "review_title": "Review at Ca lang Toan Thang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pioneer67305731214\n1 contribution\n0\nThe food was off-the-beaten path, the attitude of the staff was too bad.\nMar 2026 • Family\nThe food was not Ace, the view was nice but the attitude of the staff was bad. Advice your buffets, but when you’re ready, you’ll go for a stew. When I asked about the mango, the staff member told me that my kitchen made it all today and brought all the western tables. When I’m disgruntled, the unhappy staff says they don’t hang the patterns, the food isn’t cheap and the restaurant isn’t very luxurious, the staff is too bad. Definitely won’t be later.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 14, 2026",
