            "review_text": "jenabaintheworld\nWashington DC, District of Columbia1381 contributions\n1\nRelaxing and perfect if you want to taste many authentic fish dishes\nAug 2019 • Friends\nThis is a lovely location along the river—- although a bit challenging to find for the first time. Even though it was raining the night we went, the inside of the restaurant is also enjoyable. But it is famous for outside tables and view of the river and city. Incredible diversity of menu, esp for fish options. We really enjoyed.\nWritten August 31, 2019",
